cat > SECURITY.md <<'EOF'
# Security

Development software; no production audit or release qualification is claimed. See docs/threat-model.md and evidence/qualification/qualification-report.md. Do not use unfinished mainnet/provider/hosting paths.

Do not post wallet secrets, authorization tokens, private evidence or node private keys in issues. Report reproducible security findings privately to the repository owner through an already established contact channel; no unverified reporting address is supplied. Include component/version, sanitized steps, impact and failing vector. If no private channel exists, request one without disclosing sensitive exploit data publicly.

Dependency security advisory review, complete SBOM and supported-version policy remain release gates. Mainnet submission is disabled. Hashes/signatures do not prove physical truth or guaranteed settlement.
