# Specification resolution

The final merged master prompt governs conflicts. Existing README assets and original blueprint registries are untouched; root registries are implementation views preserving definitions and exact IDs. 120 F and 30 E overlap, 100 C overlap F, and FN/EF total exactly 86. No combined unique-feature claim is made.

